  {%- comment -%} ========== Feature story ========== {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="av-story" aria-label="What makes this cane unique">
    <h3 class="av-story__h3">Do you struggle to stand up on your own? Do you feel unsteady when walking? Are you afraid of falling in the dark?</h3>
    <h5 class="av-story__h5">There is a solution. The Astuvita support cane will help you stand up on your own, walk longer distances, and regain your confidence!</h5>
    <p class="av-story__img"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0975/4279/9687/files/e574a046420d4818bd9f12131b2e3b13_img_multi-functional-foldable-led-walking-cane-extra-handle-ezgif.com-cut_1.gif?v=1777563572" alt="" loading="lazy"></p>
    <h5 class="av-story__h5"><strong>What makes this cane unique</strong></h5>
    <p class="av-story__p"><strong>✅ Dual support handle</strong> Designed by orthopedists, the cane features a second handle that helps you rise easily from a sofa, an armchair, or any seated position — without needing anyone else's help.</p>
    <p class="av-story__img"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0975/4279/9687/files/1716391083-StandSecureAdvertorial_2_1.webp?v=1778865066" alt="" loading="lazy"></p>
    <p class="av-story__p"><strong>✅ Self-standing base</strong> Thanks to its wide base with 4 sturdy rubber feet, the cane stands up on its own. No more bending down dangerously to pick up a fallen cane!</p>
    <p class="av-story__img"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0975/4279/9687/files/9.png?v=1777557224" alt="" loading="lazy"></p>
    <p class="av-story__p"><strong>✅ Built-in LED flashlight</strong> Whether going to the bathroom at night or for an evening walk, the LED light lights your path and reduces the risk of falls.</p>
    <p class="av-story__p"><strong>✅ Built-in emergency alarm</strong> In case of a fall or emergency, simply press the button to trigger a loud alarm that will alert people nearby.</p>
    <p class="av-story__img"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0975/4279/9687/files/canne-de-marche-led-avec-alarme-securestep-8259726.webp?v=1778870627" alt="" loading="lazy"></p>
    <p class="av-story__p"><strong>✅ Foldable/telescopic design</strong> The cane folds easily to come along in the car or on a trip.</p>
    <p class="av-story__img"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0975/4279/9687/files/935b03ab-cf30-4936-9e84-aece90417e6f-ezgif.com-speed.gif?v=1778870600" alt="" loading="lazy"></p>
    <p class="av-story__p"><strong>✅ Comfortable ergonomic handle</strong> The main handle is ergonomic, and the support handle is padded for extra comfort.</p>
